        "narrative": "<p>THE STATUS OF THE GULL LAKE WALLEYE POPULATION IS PROBABLY SIMILAR TO THAT OF SAGANAGA LAKE(PROBABLY PART OF THE SAME POPULATION). THERE IS ONLY A FAIR FORAGE BASE IN GULL LAKE, WHERE PERCH ARE LOW IN NUMBER, AS ARE CISCO. SMELT MAY BE PRESENT, BUT THEIR IMPORTANCE AS FORAGE IN THIS LAKE IS UN- KNOWN. THERE APPEARS TO BE A HEALTHY SMALLMOUTH BASS POPULATION PRESENT, BUT THEY ARE DIFFICULT TO SAMPLE AND ESCAPED CAPTURE DURING THIS SURVEY.</p>",
